*> vybe-test: cobol/level_77/test_level_77_usages
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_level_77.rs

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
77 WS-BIN PIC 9(4) USAGE IS BINARY VALUE 123.
77 WS-COMP3 PIC 9(4) USAGE IS PACKED-DECIMAL VALUE 456.
77 WS-OK PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ADD 1 TO WS-BIN WS-COMP3.
    IF WS-BIN = 124
        IF WS-COMP3 = 457
            MOVE 'Y' TO WS-OK
        END-IF
    END-IF
    DISPLAY WS-OK.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-OK DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "Y"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [Y] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

